'''James Davis "Country" Warren''' (born July 20, 1939, in [[Ferriday, Louisiana]], died August 9, 2006) was a collegiate halfback and professional [[American football|football]] [[cornerback]] who played twelve seasons with the [[American Football League]]'s (AFL) [[San Diego Chargers]] and [[Miami Dolphins]] and the [[National Football League]]'s (NFL) [[Oakland Raiders]].

